  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ceramic production</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CENDA&#x2019;s first project was for to upgrade the production techniques of small farmers, and in 2002 CENDA started the current project with a community of ceramic artists.  For the present three-year period they are asking for funds to buy equipment for the third of producers who have not yet been benefited by the project, and for investigation of markets.</narrative>
  </description>
